WEBVTT

00:00:00.770 --> 00:00:03.710
Everyone, Kaleido Star is about to start.

00:00:03.710 --> 00:00:06.540
When you watch Kaleido Star,
please keep your room brightly lit,

00:00:06.540 --> 00:00:09.510
and sit as far from the TV as you can.

00:00:11.050 --> 00:00:14.180
It's a little late, but happy New Year!

00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:17.920
Please cheer us on a lot this year too, okay?

00:00:17.920 --> 00:00:21.820
Well, well, well. How did you all
spend your New Year's?

00:00:21.820 --> 00:00:24.260
Shrine visits? Special New Year's meals?
New Year's gifts?

00:00:24.990 --> 00:00:27.900
Well, as for myself, I'm not in
jolly spirits much this year.

00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:32.100
My sister was born this year, and it's the first
time the four of us spend New Years together.

00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:34.040
But as I am now, not able to do anything...

00:00:34.040 --> 00:00:38.300
I know it's not okay to let things
stay like this, but, but, but...

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:47.980
<i>Tattoo Kiss hajimari wa aka to kuro no Passion</i>

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:47.980
<i>Tattoo Kiss, the beginning is
red and black passions</i>

00:00:47.980 --> 00:00:55.290
<i>Toki ni urahara na kokoro o tayori ni</i>

00:00:47.980 --> 00:00:55.290
<i>Sometimes, we rely on our contrary hearts</i>

00:00:55.290 --> 00:00:56.390
<i>Tattoo Kiss kirifuda wa mirai o kaeru Mission</i>

00:00:55.290 --> 00:00:56.390
<i>Tattoo Kiss, the last resort is a
mission which changes the future</i>

00:00:56.390 --> 00:01:02.060
<i>Tattoo Kiss kirifuda wa mirai o kaeru Mission</i>

00:00:56.390 --> 00:01:02.060
New Wings

00:00:56.390 --> 00:01:02.060
<i>Tattoo Kiss, the last resort is a
mission which changes the future</i>

00:01:02.600 --> 00:01:10.000
<i>Koi ni aimai na kotae wa iranai</i>

00:01:02.600 --> 00:01:10.000
<i>There is no place for ambiguous answers in love</i>

00:01:10.570 --> 00:01:17.480
<i>Arienai genjitsu minai furi shite mo Bet</i>

00:01:10.570 --> 00:01:17.480
<i>Even while pretending not to see the
impossible reality, we bet</i>

00:01:17.980 --> 00:01:23.750
<i>Egatai shinjitsu Can U feel me now?</i>

00:01:17.980 --> 00:01:23.750
<i>Hard to obtain truth. Can you feel me now?</i>

00:01:23.920 --> 00:01:28.290
<i>Nesshiyasui jibun ni Say What?</i>

00:01:23.920 --> 00:01:28.290
<i>Say what to myself who gets excited easily?</i>

00:01:28.290 --> 00:01:31.660
<i>Tomadou iibun</i>

00:01:28.290 --> 00:01:31.660
<i>I'm confused, what to say</i>

00:01:33.260 --> 00:01:40.870
<i>Dreamin' samenai yume ochiteku sadame</i>

00:01:33.260 --> 00:01:40.870
<i>Dreamin' the never-waking dream,
the falling fate</i>

00:01:40.870 --> 00:01:46.640
<i>Don't stop lovin' Can't stop lovin' U
Ya ya ya</i>

00:01:40.870 --> 00:01:46.640
<i>Don't stop lovin' can't stop lovin' you
Ya ya ya</i>

00:01:48.180 --> 00:01:55.980
<i>Believe in U hikikae ni subete ushinatte mo</i>

00:01:48.180 --> 00:01:55.980
<i>I believe in you even if I lose everything for it</i>

00:01:55.980 --> 00:02:01.510
<i>Still lovin' can't stop lovin' U
No no no</i>

00:01:55.980 --> 00:02:01.510
<i>Still lovin' can't stop lovin' you
No no no</i>

00:02:06.730 --> 00:02:08.130
<i>Tattoo Kiss</i>

00:02:06.730 --> 00:02:08.130
<i>Tattoo Kiss</i>

00:02:14.570 --> 00:02:17.010
Both of you, you did well.

00:02:17.010 --> 00:02:21.080
Followed by Layla and Yuri's pairing,
we won the competition consecutively.

00:02:21.080 --> 00:02:22.540
You did a good job.

00:02:22.540 --> 00:02:26.350
I want you to start rehearsing for the New Year's
show right away, starting tomorrow.

00:02:26.350 --> 00:02:29.780
This show will be your triumphal performance.

00:02:29.780 --> 00:02:33.290
Needless to say, we're going to use
the Demon Spiral for the climax.

00:02:33.290 --> 00:02:34.720
All right, Mia?

00:02:34.720 --> 00:02:36.120
Yes.

00:02:36.120 --> 00:02:37.660
Excuse me... How about Sora?

00:02:37.660 --> 00:02:38.330
Sora...

00:02:37.660 --> 00:02:38.330
Excuse me... How about Sora?

00:02:38.330 --> 00:02:39.260
Sora...

00:02:39.260 --> 00:02:41.250
Sora is going to appear
on stage with us, right?

00:02:47.670 --> 00:02:51.470
Because as far as I'm concerned,
the festival contest isn't over yet.

00:02:57.980 --> 00:03:00.950
I can't believe you withdrew. You're the worst.

00:03:01.780 --> 00:03:05.020
You disgraced the festival.

00:03:05.020 --> 00:03:09.620
You ran away from the stage
where a serious match was.

00:03:13.330 --> 00:03:15.590
It's also a place where you destroy
the dreams of others.

00:03:17.070 --> 00:03:20.570
I told myself that I would fight to the finish.

00:03:20.570 --> 00:03:22.740
I feel shame.

00:03:22.740 --> 00:03:25.140
But in the end, for me...

00:03:25.410 --> 00:03:27.470
I'm disappointed in you, Sora.

00:04:14.560 --> 00:04:17.620
I'm sorry for the trouble I caused you.

00:04:31.770 --> 00:04:31.940
"Amazing and Sad Homecoming"

00:04:31.940 --> 00:04:34.880
Amazing and Sad Homecoming

00:04:31.940 --> 00:04:34.880
"Amazing and Sad Homecoming"

00:04:34.880 --> 00:04:37.870
Amazing and Sad Homecoming

00:04:38.380 --> 00:04:40.080
Boss! Sora just...

00:04:40.080 --> 00:04:41.620
I know.

00:04:41.620 --> 00:04:42.720
What?

00:04:42.720 --> 00:04:44.350
Tell Mia.

00:04:44.350 --> 00:04:48.250
We're removing Sora from the
New Year's show cast.

00:05:03.640 --> 00:05:05.700
So now I've come home.

00:05:11.350 --> 00:05:12.350
All right.

00:05:12.350 --> 00:05:14.080
Sora?

00:05:21.690 --> 00:05:23.460
Sora...

00:05:23.460 --> 00:05:27.590
Um...

00:05:28.200 --> 00:05:30.470
I'm home.

00:05:30.470 --> 00:05:32.300
Welcome home.

00:05:35.270 --> 00:05:37.740
Please don't shock me like that.

00:05:37.740 --> 00:05:40.260
At least call if you're coming home.

00:05:41.940 --> 00:05:43.340
Sorry...

00:05:43.340 --> 00:05:45.650
All of a sudden... What happened?

00:05:45.650 --> 00:05:50.650
Oh, well... I thought... Since it's the New Year...

00:05:50.650 --> 00:05:54.210
But, doesn't your next rehearsal start soon?

00:05:56.360 --> 00:05:58.560
Well, I decided to skip it this time.

00:05:58.560 --> 00:06:01.400
Skip it? Did something happen?

00:06:01.400 --> 00:06:03.160
No, nothing in particular.

00:06:04.030 --> 00:06:06.470
Yume's gotten so big!

00:06:07.840 --> 00:06:10.670
I'm home, Yume. It's your big sister!

00:06:14.140 --> 00:06:17.150
I just thought once my mother has a baby...

00:06:17.150 --> 00:06:20.010
There would be no room for me...

00:06:22.950 --> 00:06:27.790
Sora, both your mother and
her baby are trying hard...

00:06:27.790 --> 00:06:29.660
Let's cheer them on.

00:06:29.660 --> 00:06:30.930
Hey, Sora.

00:06:30.930 --> 00:06:32.390
What?

00:06:32.390 --> 00:06:35.100
Can you name the baby?

00:06:35.100 --> 00:06:37.530
Me? Are you sure?

00:06:37.530 --> 00:06:40.400
I always wanted you to name my baby.

00:06:40.400 --> 00:06:41.930
Okay.

00:06:48.510 --> 00:06:50.450
Thank you, Yume.

00:06:50.450 --> 00:06:56.280
Thanks to you, I feel like I finally
became a part of the family.

00:06:57.720 --> 00:07:02.350
Both my mother and father were
hoping for me to come home.

00:07:02.890 --> 00:07:07.290
I think I'll just stay here from now on.
I won't go back to the stage anymore...

00:07:11.700 --> 00:07:14.140
Yes, this is Naegino.

00:07:14.140 --> 00:07:15.140
What?

00:07:15.140 --> 00:07:17.410
Oh...

00:07:17.410 --> 00:07:19.070
Just a moment...

00:07:19.070 --> 00:07:20.810
Sora.

00:07:20.810 --> 00:07:21.810
Miss Mia...

00:07:21.810 --> 00:07:24.150
Isn't she one of your friends I met over there?

00:07:24.150 --> 00:07:25.440
What?

00:07:26.210 --> 00:07:28.520
Hello, Mia...

00:07:28.520 --> 00:07:29.720
Sora?!

00:07:29.720 --> 00:07:31.720
Everyone, I found her.

00:07:31.720 --> 00:07:34.350
Really?

00:07:31.720 --> 00:07:34.350
Oh... That's good.

00:07:34.720 --> 00:07:37.730
Sorry, I made you worry.

00:07:37.730 --> 00:07:40.300
Why did you leave without telling us?

00:07:40.300 --> 00:07:44.930
Well... Uh... there was a lot of stuff
I wanted to think over, I guess...

00:07:44.930 --> 00:07:47.340
Sora, you are coming back, aren't you?

00:07:47.340 --> 00:07:48.870
When are you coming back?

00:07:48.870 --> 00:07:51.030
Everyone's waiting for you.

00:07:51.570 --> 00:07:54.280
Well...

00:07:54.280 --> 00:07:57.050
At any rate, I'm fine, okay?

00:07:57.050 --> 00:07:59.710
So, everyone, don't worry about me. Bye...

00:08:00.110 --> 00:08:01.550
Sora!

00:08:09.290 --> 00:08:13.290
Well... I never expected you'd be home.

00:08:13.290 --> 00:08:15.400
I thought I was dreaming.

00:08:15.400 --> 00:08:17.070
You're exaggerating.

00:08:17.070 --> 00:08:19.370
How long can you stay?

00:08:19.370 --> 00:08:23.540
Well, I was thinking of taking my time
and staying for a while...

00:08:23.540 --> 00:08:25.410
Really?

00:08:25.410 --> 00:08:28.180
Honey, can you get me another beer?

00:08:28.180 --> 00:08:29.880
Well, that's unusual.

00:08:29.880 --> 00:08:32.180
The whole family's gathered after a long time.

00:08:32.180 --> 00:08:34.050
It's all right to cut loose
every once in a while, isn't it?

00:08:34.050 --> 00:08:35.810
Yes, yes.

00:08:43.190 --> 00:08:45.530
This reminds me of the old days.

00:08:45.530 --> 00:08:48.430
Well, this is a nice room.
It just looks like it belongs to a girl.

00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:52.630
Fool, did you hide in my luggage again?

00:08:52.630 --> 00:08:55.440
I always wanted come to Japan once.

00:08:55.440 --> 00:08:58.270
Anyway, I have to check out
the geisha and the kogals.

00:09:00.110 --> 00:09:03.130
You're wasting your time staying with me.

00:09:04.810 --> 00:09:08.080
The stage... I'm not...

00:09:08.080 --> 00:09:11.570
Did you really decide that
you're not going back?

00:09:12.890 --> 00:09:15.060
Yes, I did.

00:09:15.060 --> 00:09:16.520
I see.

00:09:16.520 --> 00:09:20.190
Well, the answer will make itself known naturally.

00:09:20.730 --> 00:09:22.800
If you've given up the stage,

00:09:22.800 --> 00:09:26.530
soon you'll no longer able to see me.

00:09:35.740 --> 00:09:39.910
Demon Spiral!

00:09:47.160 --> 00:09:51.590
Don't worry, Mia. I'm sure Sora will be back.

00:09:51.590 --> 00:09:52.890
Yeah.

00:09:52.890 --> 00:09:54.660
Excuse me!

00:09:54.660 --> 00:09:56.430
Don't just stand there!

00:09:56.430 --> 00:09:59.470
If you don't give instructions, I won't know how
the show's supposed to fit together, will I?

00:09:59.470 --> 00:10:02.000
Oh... Sorry.

00:10:02.000 --> 00:10:04.670
Are you trying to drag me and Leon down?

00:10:04.670 --> 00:10:06.400
If you're not interested in this, quit.

00:10:07.480 --> 00:10:09.910
What's wrong with her?!
Acting like she is so important...

00:10:09.910 --> 00:10:11.510
There's nothing we can do.

00:10:11.510 --> 00:10:13.980
The fact of the matter is,
she became No. 1 in the world.

00:10:13.980 --> 00:10:16.250
So she's full of confidence.

00:10:16.250 --> 00:10:18.340
I wonder if it's true.

00:10:23.220 --> 00:10:25.620
I'm relieved she's gone.

00:10:32.400 --> 00:10:35.040
The end of the year is getting close.

00:10:35.040 --> 00:10:37.440
So much has happened this year.

00:10:37.440 --> 00:10:40.500
That's true. It's sad to say
goodbye to this year, but...

00:10:53.920 --> 00:10:56.550
Happy New Year!

00:10:58.290 --> 00:11:01.060
This is more even lavish than
our usual New Year's feast.

00:11:01.060 --> 00:11:04.130
Mother, your ozouni soup really is the best.

00:11:04.130 --> 00:11:05.600
Please eat a lot.

00:11:05.600 --> 00:11:07.000
Yes.

00:11:13.670 --> 00:11:15.980
So, this is the town where Sora lives.

00:11:15.980 --> 00:11:18.450
It's not too bad.

00:11:19.250 --> 00:11:21.580
I wanted to come here all by myself.

00:11:21.580 --> 00:11:25.480
You don't have time to space out.
Didn't you come here to see Sora?

00:11:26.190 --> 00:11:29.060
But, the only thing I know is her address.

00:11:29.060 --> 00:11:30.890
I don't know how the roads here
work or anything.

00:11:30.890 --> 00:11:34.060
I'm a police officer. Let me handle it.

00:11:35.600 --> 00:11:37.030
Happy New Year.

00:11:37.770 --> 00:11:40.500
Sora, why don't you take a bath?

00:11:40.500 --> 00:11:43.270
Really, one should begin a new year
by cleansing one's body and...

00:11:43.270 --> 00:11:47.070
Fool, how long are you going to stay here?

00:11:47.070 --> 00:11:51.050
I'm not going back to Kaleido Stage anymore.

00:11:51.050 --> 00:11:53.480
So why don't you find somebody else?

00:11:53.480 --> 00:11:56.450
Then why are you still training?

00:11:57.050 --> 00:11:59.150
This... this is my after-meal exercise.

00:11:59.150 --> 00:12:00.220
I see...

00:12:00.220 --> 00:12:03.780
Then, I think you should take a shower
after your exercise and feel clean.

00:12:05.590 --> 00:12:07.530
Sora, you have a phone call.

00:12:07.860 --> 00:12:09.020
Yes.

00:12:10.130 --> 00:12:12.730
Well, I guess you could say that
this is very Japanese too.

00:12:13.070 --> 00:12:14.270
Who is it?

00:12:14.270 --> 00:12:15.600
Miss Kurata.

00:12:15.600 --> 00:12:17.900
What? Manami?

00:12:21.240 --> 00:12:23.640
Manami... How are you?

00:12:23.640 --> 00:12:27.920
I can't believe this! If you're back,
you could at least call!

00:12:27.920 --> 00:12:30.020
Oh... Sorry.

00:12:30.020 --> 00:12:32.520
I will be there with Sayaka and Miki.

00:12:32.520 --> 00:12:34.660
So let's have a New Year's party at your place.

00:12:34.660 --> 00:12:36.710
Oh...

00:12:38.530 --> 00:12:40.590
Excuse me!

00:12:43.700 --> 00:12:47.470
Again? Japan has a bunch of weirdos.

00:12:47.470 --> 00:12:51.070
Well, no, I think that's a natural reaction...

00:12:51.070 --> 00:12:53.170
I'll try this time.

00:12:53.170 --> 00:12:54.900
Um, excuse me...

00:12:55.780 --> 00:12:56.880
What can we help you with?!

00:12:56.880 --> 00:12:57.810
Who's this?

00:12:57.810 --> 00:12:59.750
Don't you think he looks super cool?

00:12:59.750 --> 00:13:03.320
Wow! Maybe he's a foreign
soccer player or something.

00:13:03.320 --> 00:13:05.720
No, he must be a movie star!

00:13:05.720 --> 00:13:07.820
I can't believe this! Take a picture, a picture!

00:13:07.820 --> 00:13:08.820
I'm going to take a picture with him.

00:13:08.820 --> 00:13:09.880
Uh...

00:13:10.190 --> 00:13:10.590
He is cute!

00:13:10.590 --> 00:13:11.990
Excuse me...

00:13:10.590 --> 00:13:11.990
He is cute!

00:13:12.530 --> 00:13:15.600
Do you know Sora?

00:13:15.600 --> 00:13:17.630
Would you mind taking one more picture?

00:13:17.630 --> 00:13:19.400
Sora!

00:13:21.300 --> 00:13:23.910
Happy New Year!

00:13:23.910 --> 00:13:26.140
Wow... I haven't seen you guys in a long time!

00:13:26.140 --> 00:13:27.840
Please come in.

00:13:27.840 --> 00:13:29.830
Thanks for letting us in.

00:13:31.750 --> 00:13:37.020
Wow... But, I never expected Sora
would really go to America.

00:13:37.020 --> 00:13:38.490
Really?

00:13:38.490 --> 00:13:40.290
Usually, nobody believes something like that.

00:13:40.290 --> 00:13:42.220
I was very surprised too.

00:13:42.220 --> 00:13:45.830
Even though I've been heard that being
a Kaleido Star was your dream...

00:13:45.830 --> 00:13:48.400
Manami, you saw Sora's show, didn't you?

00:13:48.400 --> 00:13:51.100
Yes. I saw that legendary great maneuver.

00:13:51.100 --> 00:13:52.870
Hey, how was it?

00:13:52.870 --> 00:13:56.500
Well, how should I describe it?

00:13:56.500 --> 00:13:59.410
I felt as if I was flying in the sky with them.

00:13:59.410 --> 00:14:00.980
Wow...

00:14:00.980 --> 00:14:10.220
It's strange, but I felt some kind of energy
through my body as I watched it.

00:14:10.220 --> 00:14:11.420
Wow...

00:14:11.420 --> 00:14:13.320
I wish I could have seen.

00:14:14.420 --> 00:14:17.530
Getting to play the leading parts and stuff
from the very beginning, I'm jealous.

00:14:17.530 --> 00:14:18.530
What?

00:14:18.530 --> 00:14:21.360
Sayaka joined a voice actors' agency.

00:14:21.360 --> 00:14:23.200
Wow... That's cool!

00:14:23.200 --> 00:14:24.530
Will you do anime voices and stuff?

00:14:24.530 --> 00:14:30.840
Well, you know, in the last round of auditions
I made it to final callbacks for the lead role.

00:14:30.840 --> 00:14:33.310
But I didn't get the role.

00:14:33.310 --> 00:14:36.140
Come on, don't get so down.
There'll be other shows!

00:14:36.140 --> 00:14:37.210
Yes.

00:14:37.210 --> 00:14:40.610
Well, I guess it means I need to
improve my skills more, huh?

00:14:42.120 --> 00:14:45.520
Come to think of it, you wanted to be
a manga artist, right Miki?

00:14:45.520 --> 00:14:49.490
I'll go to junior college and get a job
after that like everybody else.

00:14:49.490 --> 00:14:51.830
I decided to keep drawing manga as my hobby.

00:14:51.830 --> 00:14:55.230
But Miki, you're good at manga!
That's such a waste.

00:14:55.230 --> 00:14:59.390
But, you know, when it becomes your job,
you have a lot of tough times, right?

00:15:00.270 --> 00:15:04.670
And I think if I went through that,
I'd end up hating manga.

00:15:04.670 --> 00:15:07.780
But I want to keep loving manga forever, so...

00:15:07.780 --> 00:15:09.710
That sounds like you, Miki, you're such a realist.

00:15:09.710 --> 00:15:10.610
Well...

00:15:10.610 --> 00:15:13.250
So, how about you, Sora? You made
your dream come true really fast.

00:15:13.250 --> 00:15:15.020
Yeah, why you look so gloomy?

00:15:15.020 --> 00:15:18.280
Well... How should I say this?
But, I have many reasons.

00:15:18.550 --> 00:15:20.520
Hey, why don't you do something and show us?

00:15:20.520 --> 00:15:23.490
Oh, that's a good idea since it's a new year.

00:15:23.490 --> 00:15:24.490
Would you, please?

00:15:24.490 --> 00:15:25.930
Okay...

00:15:28.860 --> 00:15:30.090
Wow!

00:15:30.900 --> 00:15:31.230
Wow!

00:15:31.230 --> 00:15:31.930
Amazing!

00:15:31.230 --> 00:15:31.930
Wow!

00:15:32.370 --> 00:15:34.060
How can you do something like that?

00:15:36.270 --> 00:15:37.640
Wow!

00:15:37.640 --> 00:15:39.570
Wow... You're so cool.

00:15:40.640 --> 00:15:42.510
Oh... This applause...

00:15:42.510 --> 00:15:45.080
It's different from when I was in the festival.

00:15:45.080 --> 00:15:47.270
I wonder what is different.

00:15:47.980 --> 00:15:51.190
The audience applauds for the same reason.

00:15:51.190 --> 00:15:54.380
So I am the one who's different?

00:15:55.590 --> 00:15:57.890
I'm enjoying it now.

00:15:57.890 --> 00:16:00.790
I'm enjoying it with Manami and
the rest of my friends.

00:16:02.030 --> 00:16:05.270
That's right. The shows that everybody enjoys,

00:16:05.270 --> 00:16:08.600
that's the Kaleido Stage I like.

00:16:08.740 --> 00:16:12.000
I wanted to be in more shows like that.

00:16:14.210 --> 00:16:15.210
Bravo!

00:16:15.210 --> 00:16:16.710
I can tell you're a real pro.

00:16:16.710 --> 00:16:18.180
I'm so impressed.

00:16:19.180 --> 00:16:21.380
Then, we have to go this way.

00:16:21.380 --> 00:16:22.550
Okay.

00:16:22.550 --> 00:16:24.780
One day, I will come to see your show.

00:16:25.420 --> 00:16:26.950
Me too. Me too.

00:16:26.950 --> 00:16:28.520
Bye!

00:16:28.520 --> 00:16:30.110
Bye.

00:16:31.130 --> 00:16:34.630
You know, I've decided to go to college.

00:16:34.630 --> 00:16:37.570
It's not like I gave up a dream to be a hair stylist.

00:16:37.570 --> 00:16:41.440
I decided to take time and talk
with my parents and decide.

00:16:41.440 --> 00:16:42.560
Hm...

00:16:43.000 --> 00:16:47.440
I started thinking like this thanks to you.

00:16:47.440 --> 00:16:48.440
Me?

00:16:48.440 --> 00:16:49.810
That's right.

00:16:49.810 --> 00:16:52.080
When I was watching you working so hard,

00:16:52.080 --> 00:16:55.620
I started wanting to chase after my dream too.

00:16:55.620 --> 00:16:58.720
Sora, you gave me a dream.

00:16:58.720 --> 00:17:01.120
I did?

00:17:01.560 --> 00:17:04.430
The reason you came back to Japan...

00:17:04.430 --> 00:17:05.660
Does it have something to do with the fact

00:17:05.660 --> 00:17:07.830
that you quit in the middle of your performance
at the Circus Festival?

00:17:07.830 --> 00:17:09.860
Oh, do you know that?

00:17:09.860 --> 00:17:12.030
Well, I found out about it on the internet.

00:17:12.030 --> 00:17:15.270
Yeah... Well, that's not the only reason.

00:17:15.270 --> 00:17:17.400
Your mom was worried about you.

00:17:18.840 --> 00:17:20.210
I got a phone call from her.

00:17:20.210 --> 00:17:24.910
She asked me to spend time with you to
divert your mind, since you looked upset.

00:17:24.910 --> 00:17:27.140
You must be worried about something.

00:17:27.880 --> 00:17:32.320
I ran out on Kaleido Stage.

00:17:35.820 --> 00:17:38.090
I think that's fine.

00:17:39.460 --> 00:17:42.330
As long as you don't have any regrets about it.

00:17:43.300 --> 00:17:46.670
You'd rather just do something
than think about it

00:17:46.670 --> 00:17:48.970
because you didn't want thinking about it
to make you hesitate,

00:17:48.970 --> 00:17:51.340
so that you end up not doing it
and regretting it.

00:17:51.340 --> 00:17:53.770
You've always said that, ever
since we were in school together.

00:17:54.110 --> 00:17:58.150
So, if you don't regret your decision,
I have no problems with that.

00:17:58.150 --> 00:18:01.720
But, if you're regretting it now,

00:18:01.720 --> 00:18:04.780
why not try doing your best
to give it another shot?

00:18:05.750 --> 00:18:10.360
I think you should just shamelessly tell them
"l changed my mind and want to come back!"

00:18:10.360 --> 00:18:13.760
The fact that you can do things like that, Sora...

00:18:14.360 --> 00:18:16.630
I think that's so cool.

00:18:17.260 --> 00:18:19.000
Manami...

00:18:19.000 --> 00:18:20.940
When I met you in America,

00:18:20.940 --> 00:18:24.640
I told you that I came to see your
regretful face. Remember?

00:18:24.640 --> 00:18:26.010
Yes.

00:18:26.010 --> 00:18:27.310
You may think I'm selfish,

00:18:27.310 --> 00:18:31.140
but I don't want to see your regretful face now.

00:18:32.550 --> 00:18:35.080
What the hell are you thinking?!
Biting someone's head all of a sudden!

00:18:35.080 --> 00:18:35.980
I guess I'll end up leaving without seeing her...

00:18:35.080 --> 00:18:35.980
What the hell are you thinking?!
Biting someone's head all of a sudden!

00:18:35.980 --> 00:18:36.620
I guess I'll end up leaving without seeing her...

00:18:36.620 --> 00:18:37.550
I guess I'll end up leaving without seeing her...

00:18:36.620 --> 00:18:37.550
Don't underestimate me because
I don't understand Japanese!

00:18:37.550 --> 00:18:39.390
Don't underestimate me because
I don't understand Japanese!

00:18:39.390 --> 00:18:41.410
If you don't watch out, you'll be sorry.

00:18:42.060 --> 00:18:43.490
Mr. Policeman?

00:18:43.720 --> 00:18:45.830
Oh, Sora! I was looking for you.

00:18:45.830 --> 00:18:47.460
I brought Ken along too, as sort of an extra.

00:18:47.460 --> 00:18:48.860
Oh, it's true.

00:18:48.860 --> 00:18:50.930
"Extra"?

00:18:50.930 --> 00:18:55.000
Sorry. I keep worrying everybody.

00:18:55.000 --> 00:18:57.840
We've basically wrapped up the
New Year's show rehearsals,

00:18:57.840 --> 00:18:59.370
so I decided to try coming here.

00:18:59.370 --> 00:19:01.340
New Year's show?

00:19:01.340 --> 00:19:03.740
It's May and Leon's triumphal performance.

00:19:03.740 --> 00:19:04.950
Hm...

00:19:04.950 --> 00:19:07.820
Since the opening day is tomorrow,
I have to leave now.

00:19:07.820 --> 00:19:10.180
What? But we just met up.

00:19:10.180 --> 00:19:14.210
Unfortunately, we already purchased
the airline tickets back.

00:19:14.520 --> 00:19:15.820
I see.

00:19:16.220 --> 00:19:18.350
You are coming back, aren't you, Sora?

00:19:19.260 --> 00:19:21.630
Sora... I hope you didn't...

00:19:21.630 --> 00:19:23.130
The way I am now,

00:19:23.130 --> 00:19:27.260
even if I come back to Kaleido Stage,
I'm afraid I'll get in everybody's way.

00:19:28.500 --> 00:19:30.870
When you dropped out of the festival,

00:19:30.870 --> 00:19:33.170
I was actually a little relieved.

00:19:33.710 --> 00:19:36.240
Because I think in that situation,

00:19:36.240 --> 00:19:39.080
crying and not being able to go on
is more like the Sora I know

00:19:39.080 --> 00:19:41.070
than being totally fine with it all
and being able to perform.

00:19:41.680 --> 00:19:43.380
If you don't like battles,

00:19:43.380 --> 00:19:45.950
why don't you create a show without them?

00:19:45.950 --> 00:19:49.220
Create one? Me?

00:19:49.220 --> 00:19:53.760
I want to see more of your cheerful,
fun shows, Sora.

00:19:53.760 --> 00:19:56.530
Sora, when you're flying through the air
looking so bright, l...

00:19:58.130 --> 00:20:00.970
I...

00:20:00.970 --> 00:20:02.040
I like you.

00:20:02.040 --> 00:20:03.400
Ken...

00:20:03.400 --> 00:20:04.970
I like you lots too!

00:20:04.970 --> 00:20:07.570
I like to see you like that too.
I like it lots and lots and lots!

00:20:07.570 --> 00:20:11.710
As your number one fan, I want to see
a Sora show like that soon!

00:20:11.710 --> 00:20:12.880
Right, Mr. Number Two Fan?

00:20:12.880 --> 00:20:13.310
What? Me?

00:20:12.880 --> 00:20:13.310
Right, Mr. Number Two Fan?

00:20:13.310 --> 00:20:13.910
What? Me?

00:20:13.910 --> 00:20:16.880
Fans like us always love Sora.

00:20:16.880 --> 00:20:18.650
Oh... What I meant was...

00:20:18.650 --> 00:20:20.850
We love Sora!

00:20:20.960 --> 00:20:25.950
I'm going to create a fun
Kaleido Stage with no battles.

00:20:26.260 --> 00:20:28.200
Please be my dream, Sora.

00:20:28.200 --> 00:20:31.430
I know you can become a true Kaleido Star.

00:20:31.430 --> 00:20:34.670
All the answers are inside you.

00:20:34.670 --> 00:20:37.370
Keep going after your dream without being lost.

00:20:37.370 --> 00:20:40.770
If you do that, I'm sure the road to being
a real Kaleido Star will open for you.

00:20:41.140 --> 00:20:42.640
Yes.

00:20:42.640 --> 00:20:47.080
I'm going to create a Kaleido Stage with
no battles that's fun for everyone.

00:20:47.080 --> 00:20:49.780
That is my real dream.

00:20:49.780 --> 00:20:54.220
And if I do that, the road to being a real
Kaleido Star should open there too.

00:20:55.360 --> 00:20:56.660
What's wrong?

00:20:56.660 --> 00:20:57.990
Thank you, Ken!

00:20:59.030 --> 00:21:03.660
I will go back to Kaleido Stage
one more time. I will for sure.

00:21:03.860 --> 00:21:05.000
We're waiting for you.

00:21:05.000 --> 00:21:08.000
When you do, we'll come to
the airport to pick you up.

00:21:08.000 --> 00:21:10.440
Yes, thank you.

00:21:10.700 --> 00:21:15.040
Really... I see. I think that's fine.

00:21:15.040 --> 00:21:16.570
Thank you, Manami.

00:21:17.410 --> 00:21:19.680
You did the same for me.

00:21:19.680 --> 00:21:21.380
Let's do our best.

00:21:21.580 --> 00:21:25.350
So, that's why I came back this time.

00:21:25.350 --> 00:21:27.290
I'm sorry it's such a pathetic story.

00:21:27.290 --> 00:21:32.460
Then... After I thought a lot,
I feel like going back there. And...

00:21:32.460 --> 00:21:33.550
Honey...

00:21:42.270 --> 00:21:43.370
